:: Industrial Shady Person
<<effects>><<generate1>>
<<rng 20 30>>
<<set $temp to {}>>
<<set $temp.goingrate = $rng>>
<<set $temp.dailyrate = $temp.goingrate * 24>>

You approach the shady-looking <<person1>><<person>>, and <<his>> eyes meet yours.
<br><br>

"You look like a fun-loving <<lady>>," <<he>> asserts. "Would you be interested in making a quick buck?"
<br><br>

Your eyes betray your curiosity. "I just happen to have a lucky batch of <span class="lewd"><i>pockethole pills</i></span> in my pocket, and a high demand for <i>service providers</i>," <<he>> makes a winking gesture as if implying you should know what <<he>> means.

The <<person>> gives off shady vibe as hell, and under normal circumstances you'd stir away from people like <<him>>. But the offer of payment feels kind of tempting under your current circumstances. 
<br><br>

Seeing as you aren't reeling away already, the <<person>> continues: "You'd just need to pop one of these right here and now. And I'll take your picture so I can keep track of who I gave this pill to." You feel a hint of hesitation raise up upon the mention of your picture being taken under such a shady deal.
<br><br>

"The current going rate for this service is <<moneyGainDisplay $temp.goingrate>> per hour. So if you take the 24-hour variant, I'll pay you <<moneyGainDisplay $temp.dailyrate>> on the spot, and you won't have to see me ever again," <<he>> concludes. "So, what do you say? Interested?"
<br><br>

<<link [[Take the 24-hour variant|Industrial Shady Person Accept]]>><<set $temp.duration to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Take the 3-days variant|Industrial Shady Person Accept]]>><<set $temp.duration to 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Take the 7-days variant|Industrial Shady Person Accept]]>><<set $temp.duration to 7>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Refuse|Industrial Shady Person Refuse]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Industrial Shady Person Accept
<<effects>><<fameprostitution 5>>

You pop the pill as instructed.

<<if playerIsXChanged()>>
    <<xchange-addeffect "portal" $temp.duration>>

    As you do, a feeling of mild warmth raises up from your chest, and then a breeze feeling assaults your crotch.
<<elseif $player.gender is "m">>
    <<xchange-pink $temp.duration "portal">><<xchange-seen 1>>

    As you do, your body shifts and turns until the distintive form of a woman takes hold of your flesh. And in addition to that, a now permanent breezy feeling assaults your crotch, making you blush slightly.
<<else>>
    <<xchange-blue $temp.duration "portal">><<xchange-seen 1>>

    As you do, your body shifts and turns until the distintive form of a man takes hold of your flesh. And in addition to that, a now permanent breezy feeling assaults your crotch, making you blush slightly.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"There we go," the <<person>> takes advantage of your stunned state to take your picture, and then proceeds to hand you down the previously offered <<moneyGainDisplay `$temp.duration * $temp.dailyrate`>> as payment. "Pleasure doing business with you," and <<he>> storms off.
<br><br>

<<moneyGain `$temp.duration * $temp.dailyrate`>>
<<endevent>><<unset $temp>>

<<link [[Leave|Industrial alleyways]]>><</link>>


:: Industrial Shady Person Refuse
<<effects>>

You tell you're not interested in the offer, and turn to leave.
<br><br>

"Suit yourself," <<he>> shrugs. "The money's good. You'll probably come back." And just as you're barely within earshot, you hear <<him>> whisper under <<his>> breath: "And if not for the money... you'll probably do it for the pleasure, you <<slut>>."
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[Leave|Industrial alleyways]]>><</link>>
